{"reviews":[{"id":"B08FBGRRPK-0","r":3.0,"t":"One arrive broken","x":"One if the hanger doesn't really clip close  so the hair contine to fall out","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2022"},{"id":"B08FBGRRPK-1","r":5.0,"t":"Great product","x":"I like this bag in that it protects my wigs And I can hang it up in the closet. My wigs look the same as I wash it and put them up for storage when I take them out the bag.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B08FBGRRPK-2","r":5.0,"t":"GREAT LOVE THEM","x":"Works perfectly! DO NOT BUY the suction cup ones they are expensive and they break! BUY THESE!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B08FBGRRPK-3","r":5.0,"t":"Work perfect for travel","x":"I purchased clip in extensions to go to Vegas. I wasn\u2019t sure how I was going to travel with the extensions so, I went looking for a travel case and these came highly recommended. These were super easy to use, protected the hair, fit right in my carry-on, and the delivery was next day. Highly recommended.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2022"},{"id":"B08FBGRRPK-4","r":4.0,"t":"Overall happy","x":"One of the bags came in with the zipper broken, but was able to rig it up enough where my extensions were fine. I had to use both included bags to hold just one full set of extensions, but the hanger you attach them to seemed very secure. Happy with my purchase even though one came with a broken zipper.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B08FBGRRPK-5","r":5.0,"t":"Great for traveling","x":"My extralong braids fit in these..they are sturdy and not made of flimsy plastic..i can fold up and keep in my suitcase without the braids snagging or getting tangled..","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2023"},{"id":"B08FBGRRPK-6","r":5.0,"t":"Affordable, keeps my hair safe!","x":"[[VIDEOID:b033ddb06750ba80da47271cf688bf19]] Brought this for my new extensions. Keeps them in great condition and easy to hang in wardrobe!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2022"},{"id":"B08FBGRRPK-7","r":5.0,"t":"Wonderful products","x":"I love this wig baby, very sturdy it saves me space instead of using the foam heads\u2019 worth the price!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2021"},{"id":"B08FBGRRPK-8","r":5.0,"t":"Great storage option for your hair extensions or wigs!!","x":"These worked great for my 20 and 26 inch u part wigs. The 20 inch fit perfectly. The 26 inch had room but i had to fold about 4 inches into the bottom if the unit. I like the clip that holds the hair in place. Very sturdy and durable. No funny plastic smells and the storage bags looks nice in my closet.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B08FBGRRPK-9","r":5.0,"t":"Great for traveling with wigs!!","x":"Loved these bags for storing my wigs for traveling. I received one similar when I got my wig originally but had misplaced it since. This was the perfect replacement!! Used the second one to store my clean wefts after washing. Now I can keep the diff lengths and textures separate!!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B08FBGRRPK-10","r":4.0,"t":"Great little option!","x":"This was exactly what I was looking for.  Ordered two sets of these because I love having a variety of hair extensions to use but didn\u2019t have a great way to store them. This will definitely work well! The zipper could be a little sturdier but other than that it\u2019s great.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2022"},{"id":"B08FBGRRPK-11","r":5.0,"t":"Must have for extension owners.","x":"I kept one for myself and gave one to a friend of mine. We absolutely love these my friend especially who travels back-and-forth between her parents houses and practically lives out of her carry bag these have saved her extensions from being destroyed in transit.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B08FBGRRPK-12","r":4.0,"t":"Tell me you're a pageant mom without telling me you're a pageant mom...","x":"Who else has \"dress bags\" for their hair?  Very easy to use the hanger and it seems of good quality.  The bag itself is typical.  I wish the zipper zipped a little further for ease of putting the hair inside.  Overall very happy to get two for this price.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2022"},{"id":"B08FBGRRPK-13","r":5.0,"t":"Excellent Value","x":"Works very well. I was a little worried about the zipper getting stuck in the extensions, but there is plenty of room in the storage bag. I really appreciate having a 2 pack because I am able to properly store a full set. Great product all around :)","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B08FBGRRPK-14","r":1.0,"t":"Doesn\u2019t hold hair.","x":"The clamps do not hold the hair. I bought this for my tape in extensions and the prices of hair are constantly falling and getting tangled at the bottom of the bag. The clamp may work for 1 long strip of hair but not multiple pieces.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2023"},{"id":"B08FBGRRPK-15","r":4.0,"t":"\u00datiles","x":"Perfectas para guardar mis extensiones se mantienen libres de polvo y peinadas. Una cosa me hubiera gustado q fueran un poco m\u00e1s largas por mis extensiones se doblan un poco las puntas pero no afecta en nada el planchado","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B08FBGRRPK-16","r":5.0,"t":"Nice size hair bag...","x":"The bags are roomy and the hangers are sturdy. The connector is snug when adjusted properly on your unit. Zipper is ok, be careful not to accidentally catch hair in it. The product is nice for the price.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B08FBGRRPK-17","r":5.0,"t":"Great bags to hold all my hair extensions!","x":"I love using these to keep my hair safe and away from the cats who like to apparently chew on them lol. Hanger holds the hair well enough that I can curl or straighten the extensions while hung on it.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2023"},{"id":"B08FBGRRPK-18","r":5.0,"t":"Genial.","x":"Muy practico, no se te enredan las extenciones cada bolsa tiene bastsnte espacio para guardar mucho cabello y de cualquier largo, me ayudo a mantener mis extenciones peinadas en los viajes.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2022"},{"id":"B08FBGRRPK-19","r":4.0,"t":"Good deal","x":"I love it but only thing is I wish the zipper zips in the opposite direction because it\u2019s hard to zip without getting the hair from the extensions caught in it. You have to be careful.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B08FBGRRPK-20","r":5.0,"t":"Great Value!","x":"Great product and price. I split up my set of 22\u201d extensions between the two cases. They are slightly shorter than the extensions, but there is plenty of room for them.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B08FBGRRPK-21","r":3.0,"t":"One worked. The other did not.","x":"The hanger is weird. It clamps down on the hair to hold it. I\u2019m Hoping it doesn\u2019t make a mark on the hair. But one hanger was broken. Couldn\u2019t get it to clamp down.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2022"},{"id":"B08FBGRRPK-22","r":5.0,"t":"Great purchase!","x":"Great product! Thought it was too good for the price but it is not! The hanger is good, tight, and I have 20\u201d extensions inside the bag and they look great!!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"},{"id":"B08FBGRRPK-23","r":1.0,"t":"Very cheap and smells","x":"The bags have an awful smell and very cheap paper feel. The hangers do not hold the hair well. When I tried to comb extensions or curl them they slip out.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B08FBGRRPK-24","r":5.0,"t":"Nice gift for a beautician","x":"I love these! I got these for my bestfriend who makes custom wigs. She was able to get them personalized by a local crafter. They came out really cute !","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find the bags great for travel and storage, keeping wigs and extensions protected and untangled.","cites":[2,4,6,7,9,10,12,14]},{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the sturdiness and quality of the hanger and bag materials.","cites":[5,6,8,9,13]},{"text":"Several reviewers report receiving a broken item, particularly broken zippers.","cites":[1,5,11]},{"text":"Some reviewers say the clamps do not securely hold the hair, causing it to fall out.","cites":[1,15]},{"text":"Reviewers appreciate the value of getting two bags per purchase.","cites":[13,14]}]},"qa":[]}